---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact — NOVEXA DIGITAL" description="Tell NOVEXA DIGITAL about your website, digital strategy or content project.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Contact" title="Start with what needs to become clearer." intro="A short, useful brief is enough. Tell us where things stand and what you need the work to change." />
<section class="section dark"><div class="container contact-grid"><aside><p class="eyebrow">Project enquiries</p><h2 class="h3">What happens next</h2><p>We review your enquiry, identify any immediate questions and respond with a suitable next step. That may be a short call, a paid clarity sprint or a scoped proposal.</p><p><strong>Email</strong><br><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novexa.digital">hello@novexa.digital</a></p><p class="fine">Project engagements start from $1,500 + GST. Please do not send sensitive health, financial or authentication information through this form.</p></aside>
<form name="project-enquiry" method="POST" action="/success" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company-website"><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="project-enquiry" /><p hidden><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="company-website" /></label></p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="name">Name *</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="organisation">Organisation</label><input id="organisation" name="organisation" autocomplete="organization" /></div><div class="field"><label for="budget">Indicative budget *</label><select id="budget" name="budget" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>$1,500–$5,000 + GST</option><option>$5,000–$15,000 + GST</option><option>$15,000–$30,000 + GST</option><option>$30,000+ + GST</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="project">What needs to change? *</label><textarea id="project" name="project" required placeholder="Current situation, desired outcome and any important timing…"></textarea></div><div class="field full"><label><input type="checkbox" name="privacy-consent" required style="width:auto;min-height:auto;margin-right:.5rem" /> I have read the <a href="/privacy/" style="text-decoration:underline">privacy notice</a> and consent to NOVEXA using this information to respond.</label></div><div class="field full"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send project enquiry <span>↗</span></button></div></div></form></div></section>
<section class="section paper"><div class="narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Before you send</p><h2 class="h2">No perfect brief required.</h2><p class="lead">Useful context includes the problem you are seeing, who the work is for, what already exists, decision-makers involved and any real deadline.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
